# Interview Questions

## What is file handling?

File handling is the process of creating, reading, writing, and managing files in a program.

## Difference between write() and append()?

| write() | append() |
|----------|----------|
| Overwrites existing content | Adds content at the end |

## Why use with open()?

It automatically closes the file and prevents resource leaks.

## What is FileNotFoundError?

An exception raised when a file does not exist.

